	// GetIPAddressByIdWithResponse Get an IP address by UUID
	//
	// Resolves an IP address by its UUID alone: the parent prefix is
	// looked up from the address itself and reported as `prefixId`.
	// Use this when you hold an address UUID and not the prefix it
	// sits under.
	//
	// An unknown UUID, another account's address, or an address whose
	// parent prefix you do not own reads as `404`
	// (default deny, code E020002) - existence is never disclosed.
