	// DeleteNetworkWithResponse Delete a network (guarded, asynchronous)
	//
	// On public/gateway mounts every resource write, including retries, requires an explicit owned
	// contract registration (409 E020048). Internal operations retain their existing authorization
	// rules. Ownership, managed-resource and lifecycle guards remain. Cleanup adds no contract input.
	// Tears down the network and its children. Refused with `409` (code
	// E020004) while ANY IP address is still in use under the network's
