// on either surface additionally requires the selected registered billing contract (E020049).
// Quota is shared across all contracts and retentions (E020050); incomplete verified
// membership is E020052. Immutable replay does not reserve quota again or reselect billing.
// Declares a network. Acceptance returns `202` with an operation
// reference; the network record is created with `state=provisioning`
// and one orchestration provisions the underlying segment and the
// initial prefixes.
